  "track.animation.m.phaseread.title": "Where the animated value is read",
  "track.animation.m.phaseread.overview": "The same `x` value from `animateFloatAsState`, read in three places. Count the phases run each frame.",
  "track.animation.m.phaseread.wrapup": "Read in the composable body: it can recompose every frame. Read in `offset {}`: only layout (placement) and draw. Read in `graphicsLayer {}`: draw only. Pick the right phase and measure before optimising.",
