  "track.animation.m.aas.ev.end.same": "The end: 0 jobs",
  "track.animation.m.aas.s.launch.title": "restartAnimation: launches animateTo(100)",
  "track.animation.m.aas.s.launch.explain": "`job?.cancel()` (no job yet), then `coroutineScope.launch(start = UNDISPATCHED) { animatable.animateTo(100f, spec) }`. The scope comes from `rememberCoroutineScope()`, so the job lives as long as the composable (Runtime chapter EF).",
  "track.animation.m.aas.ev.launch": "restartAnimation: launches animateTo(100)",
