  "track.animation.m.aas.s.frame.explain": "`animateTo` sets a new value every frame; whoever reads `state.value` in composition recomposes, while reading it in `graphicsLayer {}` or `offset {}` only re-runs layout/draw (C7).",
  "track.animation.m.aas.ev.frame": "Frame: value = {v}",
