  "track.animation.m.aas.s.retarget.title": "The target changes to 40: cancel the old job, launch a new one",
  "track.animation.m.aas.s.retarget.explain": "`update()` sees 40 ≠ 100 and `animatable.isRunning`, so `isInterrupted = true`; `restartAnimation` calls `job?.cancel()` and launches `animateTo(40f)`. The Animatable starts from the current value (52), without jumping.",
  "track.animation.m.aas.ev.retarget": "The target changes to 40: cancel the old job, launch a new one",
  "track.animation.m.aas.s.end.interrupt.title": "The end: 2 jobs, 1 cancelled, value 40",
