  "track.animation.m.aas.co.noSide": "The code at the pinned commit is commented \"Avoid calling state.update on initial composition\". [[src:an-aas-src]]",
  "track.animation.m.aas.co.same": "`restartAnimation` is only called when the converter, label or target changes. [[src:an-aas-src]]",
